[{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Another-tag/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Another-tag/index.xml"}],"path":"/tags/another-tag","section":["/tags"],"summary":"","title":"Another Tag","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Another-tag/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/categories/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/categories/index.xml"}],"path":"/categories","section":[],"summary":"","title":"Categories","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/categories/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/git/"}],"path":"/git","section":[],"summary":"\u003ch1 id=\"git-related-notes\"\u003eGit related notes\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003ch1 id=\"fixing-wrong-github-user\"\u003eFixing wrong GitHub user\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake sure the remote is configured with the right user name:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-bash\" data-lang=\"bash\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003egit remote set-url origin https://cmahnke@github.com/cmahnke/hugo-13878.git\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch1 id=\"setting-the-mail-address-for-a-push\"\u003eSetting the mail address for a push\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-bash\" data-lang=\"bash\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003egit config user.email 194820+cmahnke@users.noreply.github.com\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch1 id=\"populating-a-git-repository-for-github-error-reports\"\u003ePopulating a Git Repository for GitHub error reports\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-bash\" data-lang=\"bash\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003egit remote add hugo-github-issue-13878 https://github.com/jmooring/hugo-testing\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003egit fetch hugo-github-issue-13878 hugo-github-issue-13878\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003egit checkout -B main\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003egit merge hugo-github-issue-13878/hugo-github-issue-13878\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003egit push --set-upstream origin main\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","title":"Git","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/git/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/i18n/"}],"path":"/i18n","section":[],"summary":"\u003ch1 id=\"i18n-strings\"\u003ei18n strings\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis page lists all strings from the theme\u0026rsquo;s \u003ccode\u003ei18n/\u003c/code\u003e directory in a single table with one column per language. It is generated at build time from the theme\u0026rsquo;s translation files — when a new translation or language is added, a column or new rows show up automatically, no page changes needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"how-the-themes-i18n-files-work\"\u003eHow the theme\u0026rsquo;s i18n files work\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTranslations live in the theme\u0026rsquo;s \u003ccode\u003ei18n/\u003c/code\u003e directory. Hugo loads files named \u003ccode\u003e\u0026lt;lang\u0026gt;.toml\u003c/code\u003e as the translation catalog for that language. For larger translation sets the strings can be split into fragments named \u003ccode\u003e\u0026lt;id\u0026gt;.\u0026lt;lang\u0026gt;.toml\u003c/code\u003e (for example \u003ccode\u003etags.de.toml\u003c/code\u003e or \u003ccode\u003eiiif.en.toml\u003c/code\u003e), which get merged into the main \u003ccode\u003e\u0026lt;lang\u0026gt;.toml\u003c/code\u003e files by the \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/cmahnke/projektemacher-base/blob/main/scripts/init/i18n.sh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003escripts/init/i18n.sh\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e script. Note that the merged files are generated (gitignored), while the fragments are tracked in git.\u003c/p\u003e","title":"i18n strings","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/i18n/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/de/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/de/index.xml"}],"path":"/de","section":[],"summary":"\u003ch1 id=\"einführung\"\u003eEinführung\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDeutsche Beispielseite. Diese Sprache dient als Testfall für mehrsprachige Builds des Themes, sie enthält nur diese Startseite.\u003c/p\u003e","title":"Projektemacher Base Vorlage","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/de/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Some-Tag/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Some-Tag/index.xml"}],"path":"/tags/some-tag","section":["/tags"],"summary":"","title":"Some Tag","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Some-Tag/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-1/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-1/index.xml"}],"path":"/tags/tag-1","section":["/tags"],"summary":"","title":"Tag 1","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-1/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-2/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-2/index.xml"}],"path":"/tags/tag-2","section":["/tags"],"summary":"","title":"Tag 2","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-2/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-3/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-3/index.xml"}],"path":"/tags/tag-3","section":["/tags"],"summary":"","title":"Tag 3","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-3/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-4/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-4/index.xml"}],"path":"/tags/tag-4","section":["/tags"],"summary":"","title":"Tag 4","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-4/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-with-hyphen/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-with-hyphen/index.xml"}],"path":"/tags/tag-with-hyphen","section":["/tags"],"summary":"","title":"Tag-With-Hyphen","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Tag-with-hyphen/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/index.xml"}],"path":"/tags","section":[],"summary":"","title":"Tags","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/todo/"}],"path":"/todo","section":[],"summary":"\u003ch1 id=\"introduction\"\u003eIntroduction\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere are several sources for issues:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/cmahnke/projektemacher-base/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eGitHub Issues\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe annotations / tags in various files\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThis file\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch1 id=\"general-goals\"\u003eGeneral goals\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFinish this site as documentation\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRemove duplicate functionality\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUse shortcode metadata for every shortcode\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","title":"ToDo","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/todo/"},{"lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Yet-another-Tag/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Yet-another-Tag/index.xml"}],"path":"/tags/yet-another-tag","section":["/tags"],"summary":"","title":"Yet Another Tag","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/tags/Yet-another-Tag/"},{"date":"2024-01-15T00:00:00Z","lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/3d-model/"},{"name":"iiif-manifest","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/3d-model/manifest.json"}],"path":"/posts/3d-model","section":["/posts"],"summary":"\u003ch1 id=\"3d-model-manifests\"\u003e3D model manifests\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGLB resources are emitted as Presentation API 4 \u003ccode\u003eScene\u003c/code\u003e containers with painting annotations of the type \u003ccode\u003eModel\u003c/code\u003e. The \u003ccode\u003ebare.glb\u003c/code\u003e resource has no sibling poster image — its Scene simply has no thumbnail, the build doesn\u0026rsquo;t fail. See \u003ca href=\"/iiif/page-metadata/#3d-models/\"\u003ePage metadata\u003c/a\u003e for the full rules.\u003c/p\u003e","title":"3D model manifest","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/3d-model/"},{"date":"2024-01-15T00:00:00Z","lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/index.xml"}],"path":"/posts","section":[],"summary":"","title":"Posts","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/"},{"date":"2026-10-17T00:00:00Z","lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/config/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/config/index.xml"}],"path":"/config","section":[],"summary":"\u003cp\u003eThis section documents how to configure a site built on the Projektemacher Base theme:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"params/\"\u003eSite parameters\u003c/a\u003e — all \u003ccode\u003e[params]\u003c/code\u003e options the theme\u0026rsquo;s templates understand\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"menu/\"\u003eMenus\u003c/a\u003e — how the main navigation is configured\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","title":"Config","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/config/"},{"date":"2026-10-17T00:00:00Z","lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/"},{"name":"iiif-collection","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/collection.json"}],"path":"/","section":[],"summary":"\u003ch1 id=\"introduction\"\u003eIntroduction\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe goal of this site is to provide some documentation of the functionality of this base theme and to use the provided examples as test cases in an CI environment. See also \u003ca href=\"/todo\"\u003eTODO\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","title":"Projektemacher Base template","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/"},{"date":"2026-10-17T00:00:00Z","lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/config/params/"}],"path":"/config/params","section":["/config"],"summary":"\u003ch1 id=\"site-parameters\"\u003eSite parameters\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll options are set in the site\u0026rsquo;s \u003ccode\u003ehugo.toml\u003c/code\u003e under \u003ccode\u003e[params]\u003c/code\u003e (or \u003ccode\u003e[params.\u0026lt;group\u0026gt;]\u003c/code\u003e for grouped settings). Defaults are shown where the templates define one.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"general-and-metadata\"\u003eGeneral and metadata\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\t\u003cthead\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cth\u003eParameter\u003c/th\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cth\u003eDefault\u003c/th\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cth\u003ePurpose\u003c/th\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\u003c/thead\u003e\n\t\u003ctbody\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003edescription\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e—\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eSite description, used for the \u003ccode\u003e\u0026lt;meta name=\u0026quot;description\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e and OpenGraph tags\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003ekeywords\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e—\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eComma separated keywords, rendered as \u003ccode\u003edc.subject\u003c/code\u003e meta tags\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003eslogan\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e—\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eAppended to the \u003ccode\u003e\u0026lt;title\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e on the home page\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003eauthor.name\u003c/code\u003e / \u003ccode\u003eauthor.email\u003c/code\u003e / \u003ccode\u003eauthor.uri\u003c/code\u003e / \u003ccode\u003eauthor.orcid\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e—\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eSite author, used for metadata (schema.org, codemeta, RSS)\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003epublisher\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e—\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003ePublisher name for Linked Art / schema.org metadata\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003euseragent\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e—\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eUser agent string reported to external services (e.g. Wikidata SPARQL)\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003erobots.llmsTXT\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003efalse\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eGenerate a \u003ccode\u003ellms.txt\u003c/code\u003e file listing the site\u0026rsquo;s content and author (see \u003ccode\u003erobots.txt\u003c/code\u003e)\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003edebug\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003efalse\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eEnable the theme\u0026rsquo;s debug warnings (extra build time output)\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003eenv\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e—\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eEnvironment name (e.g. \u003ccode\u003eproduction\u003c/code\u003e), used e.g. by the cookie consent service\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003estylesheets\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e—\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eList of external stylesheets to include in \u003ccode\u003e\u0026lt;head\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003edisableOpenGraph\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003efalse\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eSet to \u003ccode\u003etrue\u003c/code\u003e to skip the OpenGraph meta tags in \u003ccode\u003e\u0026lt;head\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"header-and-footer\"\u003eHeader and footer\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\t\u003cthead\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cth\u003eParameter\u003c/th\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cth\u003eDefault\u003c/th\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cth\u003ePurpose\u003c/th\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\u003c/thead\u003e\n\t\u003ctbody\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003eheaderimage\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003e/images/header.svg\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eLogo image in the header; set to \u003ccode\u003efalse\u003c/code\u003e to disable the image\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003efooter.privacy\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003efalse\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eShow a privacy policy link (\u003ccode\u003efooter.privacyUrl\u003c/code\u003e overrides the default \u003ccode\u003e/privacy\u003c/code\u003e target)\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003ecopyright\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e—\u003c/td\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003eCopyright line, rendered in the footer (set to \u003ccode\u003efalse\u003c/code\